# Only db_corpus needs excluding — it's DVC-tracked and regenerated via
# ingest, never needed for the Docker build. data/geoip's GeoLite2-City.mmdb
# IS needed (baked into the image, see Dockerfile) and data/eval is small
# enough not to bother excluding — gcloud's ignore matcher doesn't reliably
# support un-excluding a path under a blanket "data/" exclusion, unlike git.
